      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BURNSIDE HUNTER (7) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 2.25 lengths at this track in a handy 18.09 beating Honest Jan. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. CLASSIC STORY (1) ran below best last time finishing fourth (22.87) over 383m at this track from Box 8. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Expected to run well. CONTROL BUBBA (4) is long overdue for a win and in super consistent form, jumping from this box to place last time at this track (18.32), making it three straight minors. This tougher but looks a leading chance again. CLIVE'S CHANCE (2) is always hard to beat when he races at this trip.",
